#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Value form: a named #define constant as the value
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 1,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
#define TT 500
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For TT us
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
